            },
            "reviewBody": "I ran out of BBQ Sauce &amp; found this on All Recipes. I had all the ingredients on hand &amp; it was so easy, I doubt if I'll buy BBQ Sauce again. I added around 1 tsp garlic powder, 2 tsp Complete Seasoning &amp; 1/2 tsp Worcestershire. I put it on spare ribs in the slow cooker. Delicious!",
